1
00:00:00,545 --> 00:00:04,995
(Sheldon:)You can defecate in peace.
That's a win for both of us.

2
00:00:05,150 --> 00:00:06,490
(Penny:)But...

3
00:00:06,651 --> 00:00:08,961
(Sheldon:)Until this matter is resolved,

4
00:00:09,121 --> 00:00:10,501
(Sheldon:)I would like you

5
00:00:10,655 --> 00:00:12,325
(Sheldon:)to wear this sweater.

6
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:17,230
(Sheldon:)With nothing underneath it.

7
00:00:19,498 --> 00:00:20,838
(Leonard:)That's stupid. Why?

8
00:00:20,999 --> 00:00:23,779
(Sheldon:)You say it's itchy and uncomfortable.

9
00:00:23,935 --> 00:00:26,745
(Sheldon:)I say situations like this
make me feel the same way.

10
00:00:26,905 --> 00:00:29,575
(Leonard:)I'm telling you, try the hanger.

11
00:00:30,675 --> 00:00:32,275
(Sheldon:)Put it on.

12
00:00:32,444 --> 00:00:33,924
(Sheldon:)Let's share the experience.

13
00:00:35,580 --> 00:00:37,460
(Leonard:)You got it.

14
00:00:37,616 --> 00:00:39,996
(Leonard:)If this sweater shuts you up,
I'm gonna make a fortune

15
00:00:40,118 --> 00:00:41,958
(Leonard:)selling them to everyone we know.

16
00:00:43,855 --> 00:00:45,455
(Leonard:)Now all I need to do

17
00:00:45,590 --> 00:00:47,830
(Leonard:)is head down to the video store

18
00:00:48,026 --> 00:00:50,006
(Leonard:)and return the DVD.

19
00:00:53,865 --> 00:00:56,365
(Sheldon:)Oh, did I forget to tell you?

20
00:00:56,535 --> 00:01:03,025
(Sheldon:)That store went out
of business years ago.

